  "question": "设 $I_{n} = \\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}\\tan^{n}x\\mathrm{d}x$ ， $n$ 为大于1的正整数，证明 $\\frac{1}{2(n + 1)} < I_n < \\frac{1}{2(n - 1)}$",
  "answer": "$$ \\frac {1}{2} \\int_ {0} ^ {1} t ^ {n} \\mathrm{d} t < \\int_ {0} ^ {1} \\frac {t ^ {n}}{1 + t ^ {2}} \\mathrm{d} t < \\frac {1}{2} \\int_ {0} ^ {1} t ^ {n - 1} \\mathrm{d} t. $$",
  "ref_source": "textbook:puheping_math_contest_v2",
  "techniques": [
    "夹逼/估值",
    "定积分性质"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "text": "分析 作积分变量代换 $t = \\tan x$ ，将被积函数化为有理函数形式，更便于被积函数的放大或缩小."
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "text": "令 $t = \\tan x$ ，则 $I_{n} = \\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}\\tan^{n}x\\mathrm{d}x = \\int_{0}^{1}\\frac{t^{n}}{1 + t^{2}}\\mathrm{d}t.$"
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "text": "因为 $\\left(\\frac{t}{1 + t^2}\\right)' = \\frac{1 - t^2}{(1 + t^2)^2} > 0 (0 < t < 1)$ ，所以"
      },
      {
        "id": "s4",
        "text": "$$\n\\frac {t}{1 + t ^ {2}} <   \\frac {1}{1 + 1 ^ {2}} = \\frac {1}{2}.\n$$"
      },
      {
        "id": "s5",
        "text": "于是"
      },
      {
        "id": "s6",
        "text": "$$\n\\frac {1}{2} \\int_ {0} ^ {1} t ^ {n} \\mathrm{d} t <   \\int_ {0} ^ {1} \\frac {t ^ {n}}{1 + t ^ {2}} \\mathrm{d} t <   \\frac {1}{2} \\int_ {0} ^ {1} t ^ {n - 1} \\mathrm{d} t.\n$$"
      },
      {
        "id": "s7",
        "text": "即"
      },
      {
        "id": "s8",
        "text": "$$\n\\frac {1}{2 (n + 1)} <   I _ {n} <   \\frac {1}{2 n} <   \\frac {1}{2 (n - 1)}.\n$$"
      }
    ],
    "final_answer": "$$ \\frac {1}{2} \\int_ {0} ^ {1} t ^ {n} \\mathrm{d} t < \\int_ {0} ^ {1} \\frac {t ^ {n}}{1 + t ^ {2}} \\mathrm{d} t < \\frac {1}{2} \\int_ {0} ^ {1} t ^ {n - 1} \\mathrm{d} t. $$",
    "techniques_used": [
